1
00:00:00,533 --> 00:00:04,023
(Bernadette:)I've been working
on this facial expression all day.

2
00:00:06,539 --> 00:00:08,199
(Amy:)And I appreciate your effort...

3
00:00:08,407 --> 00:00:12,007
(Amy:)...but upon contemplation,
I decided I was being selfish.

4
00:00:12,211 --> 00:00:14,201
So I canceled our dinner reservations...

5
00:00:14,413 --> 00:00:18,043
(Amy:)...and came up with an even better way
to celebrate Valentine's Day.

6
00:00:18,251 --> 00:00:20,551
- What is that?
- By doing none of it.

7
00:00:20,953 --> 00:00:23,513
(Amy:)No dinner, no romance, no gifts.

8
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:26,160
(Amy:)We stay here, order a pizza...

9
00:00:26,392 --> 00:00:30,552
(Amy:)...and watch one
of your beloved Star War Trek things.

10
00:00:31,564 --> 00:00:33,054
(Sheldon:)Really?

11
00:00:33,266 --> 00:00:34,966
(Amy:)That's what you'd love, isn't it?

12
00:00:35,334 --> 00:00:36,594
(Sheldon:)More than anything.

13
00:00:36,969 --> 00:00:40,429
Well, then, that's what we're gonna do.

14
00:00:42,408 --> 00:00:45,568
(Sheldon:)Well, I don't know what to say.

15
00:00:46,179 --> 00:00:50,169
(Sheldon:)This is the most thoughtful gift
that anyone's ever given me.

16
00:00:50,416 --> 00:00:54,746
(Sheldon:)And that's including an amazing gift
I gave myself earlier today.

17
00:00:56,589 --> 00:00:58,619
(Amy:)I'm your girlfriend, that's my job.

18
00:00:58,825 --> 00:01:07,025
I know gift-giving puts pressure on you
so whatever you got me, you can return.

